{"ref":"BDB, שַׁ֫חַק","hw":"שַׁ֫חַק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁ֫חַק</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.20\">Pr 3:20</a> <strong>dust, cloud (</strong>as fine, thin<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:7\" href=\"/Psalms.89.7\">ψ 89:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:38\" href=\"/Psalms.89.38\">38</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.15\">Is 40:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁחָקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.26\">Dt 33:26</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>fine dust</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ מֹאזְנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.15\">Is 40:15</a> (sim. of insignif.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  (thin) <em>cloud</em>, usually pl. (often ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמַיִם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.26\">Dt 33:26</a> (poem), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.8\">Is 45:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.9\">Je 51:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 35:5\" href=\"/Job.35.5\">Jb 35:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:28\" href=\"/Job.36.28\">36:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 37:21\" href=\"/Job.37.21\">37:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:37\" href=\"/Job.38.37\">38:37</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:6\" href=\"/Psalms.36.6\">ψ 36:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:11\" href=\"/Psalms.57.11\">57:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:35\" href=\"/Psalms.68.35\">68:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:18\" href=\"/Psalms.77.18\">77:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:23\" href=\"/Psalms.78.23\">78:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:5\" href=\"/Psalms.108.5\">108:5</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.20\">Pr 3:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.28\">8:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.12\">2 S 22:12</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:12\" href=\"/Psalms.18.12\">ψ 18:12</a>; = heavens, sky <a data-ref=\"Job 37:18\" href=\"/Job.37.18\">Jb 37:18</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִרְקִיעַ</span>), and (sg.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:7\" href=\"/Psalms.89.7\">ψ 89:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:38\" href=\"/Psalms.89.38\">38</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁחֹר","prev":"BDB, שָׁחַק"}